allback migrated 4/5 selected per-file tickets to grouped replacements; newly closed=3, already closed=1, errors=1.","timestamp":1788575635713201001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Migration recovery: 51 of 1,499 source tickets were already closed as superseded; the remaining pass is switching from repeated alias scans to a one-time canonical-ID map. Tracker delivery was flushed before resuming.","timestamp":1788576889307894001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Migration checkpoint: 57 source tickets are closed as superseded. Serial administrative-close prechecks are whole-store-bound at this corpus size; profiling is underway before the remaining 1,442 closes.","timestamp":1788577254131325001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Local CLI fallback migrated 1481/1499 selected per-file tickets to grouped replacements; newly closed=1413, already closed=68, errors=18.","timestamp":1788581415870859001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Local CLI fallback migrated 18/18 selected per-file tickets to grouped replacements; newly closed=18, already closed=0, errors=0.","timestamp":1788581522225998001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Consolidation complete: 1,499 per-file children were mapped once to 114 grouped leaf tickets under 6 workstream stories and closed as superseded. The original epic is superseded and closed. Final audit: 1,499 closed/superseded sources, 1,499 exact live superseders, 1,499 unique file-impact paths, and 121/121 new epic/story/leaf plans passing the deterministic readiness and clarity floor; no invariant failures.","timestamp":1788582102402409001},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Grouped-remediation readiness check at origin/main dcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d: of 43 leaves returned by next-batch after 4 inspected leaves were blocked, 28 declare at least one path absent from the current tree (262 missing path entries); 15 have all declared paths present. This is a path-existence check, not a complete scope audit. Four inspected leaves were blocked with their exact findings: nonlineal-crotchety-galago (one deleted test module), prideful-floggable-porcupine (the declared diffing directory is absent), dripping-viperous-chickadee (owned executable code changed since its immutable AST basis), and proposed-nomophobic-piranha (owned executable code changed since its pinned basis). No repository code was edited and no Gerrit change was pushed. A grouped change also requires adapting leaf-local HEAD^..HEAD path checks to a batch commit while retaining each leaf's path-scoped semantic evidence and non-author review rows. Fresh origin/main worktree prepared at /Users/joeoakhart/worktrees/rebar-comment-remediation-group-01 with the pinned Python venv and commit hooks.","timestamp":1792719249698973457},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Path-history follow-up to the readiness comment: of the 262 absent old paths among the 43 available leaves, Git recognizes 229 as renames at >=50% similarity (mostly src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler -> src/rebar/reconciler and tests/*/rebar_reconciler -> tests/*/reconciler). The remaining 33 have no >=50% rename match in this comparison; that does not establish deletion of their behavior or prose. The earlier 28/43 figure describes stale ticket paths, not 28 irrecoverable leaves. Re-scope should map the 229 renamed paths and investigate the 33 unmatched paths, then refresh immutable bases and block inventories before grouping commits.","timestamp":1792719379512277788},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Grouped remediation landed on main through Gerrit change 3069: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/3069. One commit 0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379 covers 2 leaf tickets, 20 test files, 44 reconciler docstrings and 33 lifecycle prose blocks. Local make verify passed (19,693 passed, 93 skipped). LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, 0 unresolved comments; Gerrit and GitHub main both point to the merged SHA. CI_RESULT {\"run_id\":\"39893455118\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"duration\":1495,\"fixes_applied\":[],\"retry_count\":0}. Leaf tickets remain in_progress until a non-author posts their required 44-row and 33-row TSV review receipts.","timestamp":1792726542695435777}],"created_at":1788570271406512725,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dd5c5725-7abb-4bc4-b3d1-8ec48c2c42a4","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d8a3-ff71-8112-4e55"},{"link_uuid":"03175aca-b193-42b7-9839-2be42729ce3f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"},{"link_uuid":"e108df27-9438-439f-a263-328196118d8a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"61c7-401f-9fd5-406f"},{"link_uuid":"b6755dc3-c8dd-496a-9ba3-62acd5881255","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e057-1f93-5328-4c25"},{"link_uuid":"e73da433-c70f-4a94-9c27-4ae5e848d293","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"277a-df4f-d7e8-4aa1"},{"link_uuid":"a60879f4-ffca-4d5f-a39a-43a0e3c1f313","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"06c9-d87c-5237-4a61"},{"link_uuid":"6feba82a-36b3-4282-9076-f524db653f3a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"54e6-d821-a0ac-4930"},{"link_uuid":"0fe6e2c6-ec2e-4292-9953-a72a1e7f5143","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a67b-5e3f-dfea-46dd"},{"link_uuid":"e35972aa-cd80-4f85-a3f7-da9d67e9c779","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"270c-4d77-f231-4178"}],"description":"## Context\nThis replacement tree consolidates the retired 1,499-ticket per-file audit into six workstream stories and 117 path-disjoint remediation leaves. The leaves cover 1,514 distinct file-impact paths: 1,499 migrated paths plus 15 paths added without retired-source mappings. This epic makes no repository edits.\n\n## Plan\n- Complete and close every leaf through its recorded checks, independent semantic review, Gerrit gates, merge, and completion verification.\n- Close each workstream after it records the exact migration and execution inventories required by its plan.\n- Concatenate the six story migration TSVs, add `story-alias`, sort by path, and store the 1,499-row result in a dedicated `session_log` linked `relates_to` this epic. Schema: `path<TAB>story-alias<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>source-ticket-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count`.\n- Concatenate the six story execution TSVs, add `story-alias`, sort by path, and store the 1,514-row result in the same log. Schema: `path<TAB>story-alias<TAB>replacement-leaf-alias<TAB>scope-count<TAB>file-impact-count<TAB>source-count`.\n- Record both row counts and SHA-256 values in the epic completion comment, together with the six story-log ids.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] All six workstream stories are closed.\n- [ ] All 117 remediation leaves are closed.\n- [ ] The epic migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 rows.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 distinct migrated paths.\n- [ ] The migration TSV contains exactly 1,499 distinct retired source tickets.\n- [ ] Every retired source ticket has exactly one net-active live replacement leaf.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every migration row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] The epic execution TSV contains exactly 1,514 rows.\n- [ ] The execution TSV contains exactly 1,514 distinct paths.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `scope-count=1`.\n- [ ] Every execution row has `file-impact-count=1`.\n- [ ] Exactly 1,499 execution rows have `source-count=1`.\n- [ ] Exactly 15 execution rows have `source-count=0`.\n- [ ] Every migrated Scope constraint has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every migrated consumer contract has a non-author `semantic-preservation=PASS` row with immutable before/final citations.\n- [ ] Every edited prose block has a non-author `bloat-removal=PASS` row.\n- [ ] Every recorded leaf verification command exits 0 at its cited commit.\n- [ ] Every leaf completion trail records its Gerrit Change-Id, `LLM-Review +1`, `Verified +1`, and zero unresolved comments.\n- [ ] Every leaf completion trail records Gerrit `MERGED` status and the exact merged commit reachable from `origin/main`.\n- [ ] The epic log records both combined TSVs and all six story-log ids.\n- [ ] The epic completion comment cites the epic log and records both row counts and both SHA-256 values.\n\n## Completion boundary\nClose this epic only after every descendant is closed and every inventory check above passes.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","06c9-d87c-5237-4a61"],["relates_to","270c-4d77-f231-4178"],["relates_to","277a-df4f-d7e8-4aa1"],["relates_to","54e6-d821-a0ac-4930"],["relates_to","59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"],["relates_to","61c7-401f-9fd5-406f"],["relates_to","a67b-5e3f-dfea-46dd"],["relates_to","e057-1f93-5328-4c25"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This container makes no repository edits directly. Its descendant group tickets hold the exact edit paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"e0bfbd2d-e081-4de5-9ec9-214386759b9d","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","ticket_type":"epic","title":"Remediate bloate